---
source: crates/mcp/tests/server/startup.rs
expression: instructions
---
gsttt answers what a change affects, from an index of imports and contracts (HTTP routes, GraphQL operations, gRPC methods, tables, queues, env variables) across the repository. Call impact before changing a file that others may use, or with changed=true before finishing a task; dependents before renaming or deleting; path to learn how two files are connected; contract to find who serves and who calls an endpoint. A question about one function, class, method or variable goes to impact with its name in names, beside the file in paths: the answer lists its direct callers, and asking again about a caller goes further. Every answer ends with what it covered and how fresh it is; when coverage names a gap, say so instead of assuming nothing is affected.
